# Travel Planning AI Agent Based on Cross-Platform Meta-Search

## Overview

Travel Planning AI Agent is an end-to-end agentic travel planning platform that transforms natural-language travel requests into optimized flight and hotel itineraries.

Unlike traditional OTA (Online Travel Agency) workflows that require users to manually fill multiple search forms, compare providers, and iterate through dates, the system allows users to express trip intentions in free-form language such as:

> "I want to spend 5 days in Japan next October, departing from NYC, budget under $2500, preferably near public transit and avoid overnight flights."

The platform leverages GPT-4 and LangChain to extract structured constraints, orchestrates multiple travel APIs, evaluates thousands of candidate itineraries, and generates personalized recommendations with natural-language explanations.

---

# System Architecture

User
↓
Next.js Frontend
↓
FastAPI Gateway
↓
Agent Orchestrator (LangChain)
├── Constraint Extraction Tool
├── Flight Search Tool
├── Hotel Search Tool
├── Budget Optimizer
├── Ranking Engine
└── Itinerary Generator
↓
External APIs
├── Amadeus Flight API
├── Hotel Search API
├── Geolocation API
└── Currency Exchange API
↓
Redis Cache
↓
PostgreSQL

